        "en": "Many pet owners praise the veterinary doctors and nurses for their compassion, attentiveness, and medical competence. Longtime clients highlight familiar staff members who treat companion animals with warmth and dedication during appointments. Whilst an occasional reviewer felt dismissed during billing disputes, the vast majority describe a supportive, reassuring team across routine checkups."
