        "en": "Gentle handling for diverse pet species"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet parents report that dogs, cats, and exotic animals are handled with gentle patience during clinical visits. Several reviewers with nervous rescues or anxious large breeds note that clinicians took time to soothe their pets and make procedures manageable. Clients express trust in the hospital's calm approach to anxious companions."
      },
      "mentions": 15,
      "sentiment": "positive"
    },
