        "en": "Client feedback regarding treatment costs leans distinctly negative across recent reviews. Although one client considered prices reasonable, multiple reviewers expressed strong frustration over unexpected fees, steep invoices, and perceived overcharging. Pet owners frequently recommend asking for an itemised cost estimate before agreeing to non-urgent procedures."
      },
